>Sign in<!----></a><!--]--><!----><!--]--></div></div></header> <main class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-(--page-width) px-(--page-gutter) py-10 md:py-14\"><!--[-1--><!--[--><div class=\"space-y-12\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-6 lg:flex-row lg:items-end lg:justify-between\"><div class=\"max-w-3xl space-y-3\"><!--[0--><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.22em] text-(--color-accent-strong) uppercase\">Personal reading tracker</p><!--]--> <h1 class=\"font-display text-4xl text-(--color-ink) md:text-5xl\">Build a shelf that remembers what you actually read.</h1> <!--[0--><p class=\"max-w-2xl text-base leading-7 text-(--color-muted)\">Shelf keeps your next read, your current stack, and the books you already finished in one calm place. Search the catalog, rate what you finish, and keep your reading goal in sight.</p><!--]--></div> <!--[0--><div class=\"shrink-0\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-3\"><!--[-1--><!--]--></div><!----></div><!--]--></div><!----> <section class=\"grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-[1.3fr_0.7fr]\"><section class=\"rounded-(--radius-card) border border-(--color-border) bg-(--color-surface) shadow-(--shadow-card) p-6 md:p-7\"><!--[0--><div class=\"space-y-2\"><!--[-1--><!--]--> <!--[0--><h2 class=\"font-display text-2xl text-(--color-ink)\">Everything you need to keep reading</h2><!--]--> <!--[0--><p class=\"text-sm leading-6 text-(--color-muted)\">Shelf stays focused on the few jobs a reading app should do well.</p><!--]--></div><!--]--> <!--[0--><div class=\"mt-5\"><div class=\"grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2\"><!--[--><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-(--color-border-strong) bg-(--color-surface-soft) p-4\"><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-(--color-ink)\">Search with intent</p> <p class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-(--color-muted)\">Look up books by title, author, or Open Library identifier, then bring the ones you care about onto your shelf.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-(--color-border-strong) bg-(--color-surface-soft) p-4\"><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-(--color-ink)\">Keep an honest shelf</p> <p class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-(--color-muted)\">Move books from to-read to reading to finished so your list reflects what is actually happening.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-(--color-border-strong) bg-(--color-surface-soft) p-4\"><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-(--color-ink)\">Rate what you finish</p> <p class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-(--color-muted)\">Leave yourself a quick verdict while the book is still fresh, so your shelf becomes a record and not just a queue.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-(--color-border-strong) bg-(--color-surface-soft) p-4\"><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-(--color-ink)\">Track the year clearly</p> <p class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-(--color-muted)\">Set an annual reading goal and see your progress every time you open the app.</p></div><!--]--></div><!----></div><!--]--></section><!----> <section class=\"rounded-(--radius-card) border border-(--color-border) bg-(--color-surface) shadow-(--shadow-card) p-6 md:p-7\"><!--[0--><div class=\"space-y-2\"><!--[0--><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.22em] text-(--color-accent-strong) uppercase\">How Shelf works</p><!--]--> <!--[0--><h2 class=\"font-display text-2xl text-(--color-ink)\">From curiosity to finished</h2><!--]--> <!--[0--><p class=\"text-sm leading-6 text-(--color-muted)\">A reading list only helps if it stays honest. Shelf keeps the routine lightweight.</p><!--]--></div><!--]--> <!--[0--><div class=\"mt-5\"><ol class=\"space-y-4\"><!--[--><li class=\"flex gap-4\"><span class=\"inline-flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-(--color-surface-soft) text-sm font-semibold text-(--color-accent-strong)\">1</span> <div class=\"space-y-1\"><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-(--color-ink)\">Find the book</p> <p class=\"text-sm leading-6 text-(--color-muted)\">Start with search when a recommendation, review, or impulse catch your attention.</p></div></li><li class=\"flex gap-4\"><span class=\"inline-flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-(--color-surface-soft) text-sm font-semibold text-(--color-accent-strong)\">2</span> <div class=\"space-y-1\"><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-(--color-ink)\">Add it to your shelf</p> <p class=\"text-sm leading-6 text-(--color-muted)\">Keep the titles you want to read, are reading now, or already finished in one place.</p></div></li><li class=\"flex gap-4\"><span class=\"inline-flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-(--color-surface-soft) text-sm font-semibold text-(--color-accent-strong)\">3</span> <div class=\"space-y-1\"><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-(--color-ink)\">Finish with context</p> <p class=\"text-sm leading-6 text-(--color-muted)\">Mark the book as read, leave a rating, and keep your reading history useful.</p></div></li><!--]--></ol><!----></div><!--]--></section><!----></section> <section class=\"space-y-5\"><div class=\"space-y-2\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.22em] text-(--color-accent-strong) uppercase\">On readers' shelves</p> <h2 class=\"font-display text-3xl text-(--color-ink)\">A few books worth keeping close</h2> <p class=\"max-w-3xl text-sm text-(--color-muted)\">Featured titles show the kind of record Shelf keeps: what the book is, where it sits in your\n\t\t\t\treading life, and how you felt about it when you were done.</p></div> <div class=\"grid gap-5 lg:grid-cols-3\"><!--[--><article aria-label=\"Welcome to Dead House by R. L. Stine\" data-book-card=\"\" class=\"flex h-full flex-col gap-4 rounded-(--radius-card) border border-(--color-border) bg-(--color-surface) p-5 shadow-(--shadow-card)\"><h3 class=\"font-display text-2xl text-(--color-ink)\">Welcome to Dead House</h3> <p class=\"text-sm leading-6 text-(--color-muted)\">A family moves into a town where every house feels wrong and every neighbor seems just a little too friendly.</p> <div class=\"mt-auto space-y-4\"><div data-book-card-meta=\"\" class=\"grid grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_auto] items-start gap-4\"><p class=\"min-w-0 text-sm font-medium text-(--color-ink)\">R. L. Stine</p> <!--[0--><span class=\"rounded-full border border-(--color-border-strong) bg-(--color-surface-soft) px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.16em] text-(--color-accent-strong) uppercase\">Reading</span><!--]--></div> <div data-book-card-footer=\"\" class=\"grid min-h-9 grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_auto] items-center gap-3 text-xs text-(--color-muted)\"><span class=\"min-w-0 truncate\">Open Library: OL3282715M</span> <!--[0--><span class=\"rounded-full bg-(--color-surface-soft) px-3 py-1 font-semibold text-(--color-ink)\">Rated 4/5</span><!--]--></div></div></article><!----><article aria-label=\"The Invasion by K. A. Applegate\" data-book-card=\"\" class=\"flex h-full flex-col gap-4 rounded-(--radius-card) border border-(--color-border) bg-(--color-surface) p-5 shadow-(--shadow-card)\"><h3 class=\"font-display text-2xl text-(--color-ink)\">The Invasion</h3> <p class=\"text-sm leading-6 text-(--color-muted)\">Five friends stumble into a secret alien war and learn that Earth has already been infiltrated.</p> <div class=\"mt-auto space-y-4\"><div data-book-card-meta=\"\" class=\"grid grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_auto] items-start gap-4\"><p class=\"min-w-0 text-sm font-medium text-(--color-ink)\">K. A. Applegate</p> <!--[0--><span class=\"rounded-full border border-(--color-border-strong) bg-(--color-surface-soft) px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.16em] text-(--color-accent-strong) uppercase\">To read</span><!--]--></div> <div data-book-card-footer=\"\" class=\"grid min-h-9 grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_auto] items-center gap-3 text-xs text-(--color-muted)\"><span class=\"min-w-0 truncate\">Open Library: OL24959144M</span> <!--[-1--><!--]--></div></div></article><!----><article aria-label=\"The Sun Also Rises by Ernest Hemingway\" data-book-card=\"\" class=\"flex h-full flex-col gap-4 rounded-(--radius-card) bo